"Format</emph></defaultinline></switchinline> dialog, which enables you to "
"define the table properties such as borders, background, and column "
"width.</ahelp>"
msgstr ""
"<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:PB_TBL_FORMAT\">Բացում է <"
